    <div class="itdgl-faq-intro">
      <p>A skincare e-commerce website in Jaipur, India needs skin quiz + routine builder + subscription + WhatsApp + AR + certification display. Jaipur is India's coloured-gemstone capital (emerald + kundan + polki) and one of the world's top destination-wedding cities. Handblock printing (Sanganer + Bagru) + Rajasthani heritage textiles + luxury Ayurveda cluster. Category-specific Shopify converts 2-4% vs 0.5-1.2% for generic. This FAQ answers 12 questions Jaipur skincare founders ask most.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-evidence-band">
      <strong>ITD SKINCARE + D2C PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong>
      This FAQ is grounded in live category work. ITD's skincare D2C 50-piece cluster + case studies including <a href='/resources/Kama_Ayurveda_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php' style='color:#4338ca;font-weight:700;'>Kama Ayurveda</a>, <a href='/resources/Plum_Beauty_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php' style='color:#4338ca;font-weight:700;'>Plum</a>, <a href='/resources/Sugar_Cosmetics_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php' style='color:#4338ca;font-weight:700;'>Sugar</a>, <a href='/resources/WOW_Skin_Science_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php' style='color:#4338ca;font-weight:700;'>WOW Skin Science</a>, and 11 GCC beauty pages ground this playbook. Every answer below is written from real client engagements and published playbooks, not templated content.
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How much does a skincare Shopify build cost in Jaipur?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Boutique Rs 3-6 lakh (5-7 weeks) — theme + core apps + 15-40 SKUs + skin quiz + subscription + WhatsApp + returns. Mid-market Rs 6-12 lakh (8-12 weeks) — premium theme + full skin quiz + routine builder + subscription + AR (where applicable) + multi-language + advanced retention flows. Enterprise Rs 12-22 lakh (12-16 weeks) — custom theme + advanced fit + multi-region + Arabic + Hindi + luxury unboxing. Post-launch Rs 40K-2 lakh/month. Skincare-specific apps Rs 30-100K/month tooling.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How long does a skincare Shopify build take in Jaipur?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Boutique 5-7 weeks. Mid-market 8-12 weeks. Enterprise 12-16 weeks. Timeline gates: theme + skin quiz integration (3-4 weeks), subscription + refill flow (2-3 weeks), WhatsApp Cloud API + retention flows (2-3 weeks), photography + before-after (compliance-safe) integration (2-3 weeks), compliance + certification display (1-2 weeks), multi-region if needed (2-4 weeks additional). In Jaipur timing to complete 6-8 weeks pre-Wedding season (Oct-March) extreme + Teej + Diwali + Karva Chauth + Jaipur Literature Festival tourism peak captures gifting + wedding + festive concentration.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What Shopify apps do skincare brands need?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">(1) Skin quiz + routine builder: Tolstoy ($200-1000/mo), Octane AI ($200-800/mo), Rebuy ($100-500/mo). Reduces wrong-SKU purchase + boosts AOV. (2) Subscription + refill: Recharge, Bold, Shopify Subscriptions. (3) WhatsApp Cloud API: Interakt, AiSensy. Restock + routine + refill + winback flows. (4) Reviews + photo/video UGC: Judge.me, Loox, Yotpo. (5) Klaviyo email + SMS + wishlist. (6) Multi-currency: Shopify Markets. (7) AR try-on (select categories): Perfect Corp YouCam for makeup-adjacent. (8) Before-after gallery: compliance-safe custom PDP block. (9) Ingredient + INCI display: custom PDP or ingredient app. Total tooling Rs 30-100K/month.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Should we build skincare on Shopify, Magento, or custom?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Shopify Standard for Rs 15 lakh-1.5 crore/month. Shopify Plus for Rs 1.5-25 crore/month + subscription at scale. Headless for Rs 5+ crore/month + custom-heavy. For Jaipur skincare brands, Shopify Standard right year 1-2, upgrade to Plus at Rs 2 crore/month + subscription base >1,000 active.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What conversion rate is realistic for skincare Shopify in Jaipur?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Well-executed skincare Shopify: 2-4% overall (one of the strongest D2C categories). First-time: 1-2%. Returning: 5-12%. Subscription-cohort: 12-25%. Key levers: skin quiz (adds 30-50% AOV + reduces wrong-SKU purchase 40-60%), routine builder (adds 20-40% AOV), sampling programme (reduces first-purchase risk), video PDP + before-after (adds 20-40% conversion for clinical brands), WhatsApp routine consultation (adds 15-30% on premium AOV). Poor Shopify (no skin quiz + weak PDP) drops to 0.5-1.5%. In Jaipur + Traditional heritage-luxury + wedding-heavy + destination-wedding market + tourism-fed demographic, baseline + Diwali/Karva Chauth/wedding peaks lift 30-60%.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does multi-currency + multi-region setup work for skincare in India?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Shopify Markets + local payment + regional inventory + trilingual creative. India: Razorpay/Cashfree + EMI/BNPL. GCC: Tap/Stripe/Tabby. Regional compliance display (CDSCO India / ESMA UAE / SFDA Saudi + Arabic labelling on GCC pages). Adds 2-4 weeks + Rs 1-3 lakh to base build. For Jaipur skincare brands targeting India + GCC + NRI diaspora simultaneously, multi-region essential from launch. Arabic + Hindi + English trilingual creative for GCC.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What post-launch Shopify retainer for skincare in Jaipur?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Ongoing feature dev + landing pages Rs 25-80K/month. App + theme + Shopify updates Rs 20-50K/quarter. CRO + A/B testing Rs 30K-1.5 lakh/month. Analytics audit Rs 30-70K/quarter. Total Rs 40K-2 lakh/month. Skincare needs seasonal + Diwali + Karva Chauth + wedding + Summer sunscreen + Winter moisturiser landing pages — adds Rs 30-80K/quarter.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Do skincare brands need mobile app + native app?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Not year 1-2. Justified at Rs 2 crore+/month + subscription base >2,000 + community-driven brand. Native app benefits: push notifications for routine + refill reminders (30-50% engagement lift), better subscription UX, exclusive drops + community, personalised routine. Cost Rs 10-30 lakh initial + Rs 40K-1.5 lakh/month. For most Jaipur skincare brands, WhatsApp Cloud API + Klaviyo email + Instagram broadcast substitute effectively until scale.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do skincare brands handle returns + exchanges in Jaipur?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Skincare returns 15-25% (moderate). Returns portal (AfterShip $30-200/mo). Skincare-specific: (1) Opened + used product no-return policy (hygiene) UNLESS reaction — reaction-refund 100%. (2) Unopened + within window (15-30 days) refund. (3) Wrong-item + damaged-in-shipping 48hr refund + replace. (4) Sample programme reduces first-purchase risk (send 2-4 samples with first order). (5) Skin quiz reduces wrong-SKU purchase 40-60%. Reverse logistics: Rs 40-120/pickup India, AED 15-40 GCC. In Jaipur, CDSCO + BIS + Rajasthan FDA + local consumer-protection defines statutory minimums.</div>
      </div>
